---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL } from '../config/site';

const canonicalUrl = 'https://calcumetrics.com/cookie-policy';

const jsonld = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'WebPage',
      name: 'Cookie Policy',
      url: canonicalUrl,
      description: 'What cookies and storage Calcumetrics uses, their purpose, and how to manage your preferences.',
      publisher: { '@id': 'https://calcumetrics.com/#org' },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://calcumetrics.com/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Cookie Policy', item: canonicalUrl },
      ],
    },
  ],
};
---
<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | Calcumetrics"
  description="Learn how Calcumetrics implements a cookieless architecture, privacy-preserving analytics, local browser storage preferences, and statutory data protections."
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
>
  <Fragment slot="head"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonld)} /></Fragment>
  <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent transition-standard">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
        <li class="text-text-primary font-medium" aria-current="page">Cookie Policy</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-2">Last updated: 24 September 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
      This policy explains how Calcumetrics (calcumetrics.com) uses cookies and browser local storage, their exact technical purposes, and how you can control your preferences.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">1. Current implementation: Functional browser storage</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Calcumetrics does <strong>not</strong> currently set any tracking, profiling, or third-party advertising cookies. We use client-side <code class="text-xs bg-disabled-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">localStorage</code> solely to remember your immediate UI preferences between visits:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted mb-4 pl-2">
      <li><code class="text-xs bg-disabled-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">cm_currency</code>: Stores your preferred display currency symbol (e.g. INR, USD, EUR, GBP) for universal calculators.</li>
      <li><code class="text-xs bg-disabled-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">cm_theme</code>: Stores your dark mode or light mode appearance preference.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      This data stays strictly on your local device. It is never transmitted to our servers or accessible to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">2. Planned advertising cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Calcumetrics plans to display advertising via Google AdSense in future. When enabled, Google and its certified vendor partners may use cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) and device identifiers to serve ads and measure ad impressions.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <strong>Future Consent Management:</strong> Before any advertising cookies are activated for visitors in the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom, Switzerland, or other regulated jurisdictions, an interactive Consent Management Platform (CMP) dialog will be deployed in accordance with Google EU User Consent Policy and IAB TCF standards. This policy will be updated before any advertising cookies are enabled.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">3. Self-hosted typography &amp; zero external tracking</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      All web fonts (including Inter and Playfair Display) are self-hosted locally directly on our own domain servers. We do not load fonts, scripts, or stylesheets from Google Fonts or third-party CDNs, ensuring that your IP address and browser headers are never transmitted to external font services.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">4. Cookieless web analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics)</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure high-level traffic and site performance. Cloudflare Web Analytics is 100% cookieless and does not use local storage or fingerprinting. It does not track users across sites, does not collect personal data, and does not log IP addresses.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">5. How to control and delete browser storage</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      You can clear your stored preferences (such as remembered currency) at any time by clearing your browser's local storage and cache in your browser settings. To opt out of interest-based advertising across participating networks, you may visit the <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Digital Advertising Alliance opt-out</a> or <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Ad Settings</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">6. Questions and updates</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      If you have questions about our cookie or local storage practices, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`} class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">{SITE_EMAIL}</a>. We update this policy whenever storage mechanisms change.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
